      "value": "@{59715a9e4979f85df8d62ef5|full_name}: That is what I am saying Tupper I am not a full member of the bE team but I am a moderator for them both on the forums and ingame. But I am also held to a very high standard due to the power I've been given and I am accountable for any and all kicks I give. I could see it being the same thing here. But as Ron has said its not ideal at least not in the short term, maybe it will be something we can see in the long term but its something that they have to know they can trust someone with such power.",
